# Extensions

Syntax the parser reads in addition to djot's. Every extension is off in the
djot profile and is switched on by itself. For djot's own syntax, see the
[djot syntax reference](https://htmlpreview.github.io/?https://github.com/jgm/djot/blob/master/doc/syntax.html).

Each section ends with the properties that the extension changes.

